Feature: Petstore API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given I have a pet payload\n    When I send a POST request to the petstore API\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the pet should be created\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve an existing pet\n    Given I have the ID of an existing pet\n    When I send a GET request to the petstore API\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the pet details should be returned\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet\n    Given I have the ID of an existing pet and updated payload\n    When I send a PUT request to the petstore API\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the pet should be updated\n\n  Scenario: Delete an existing pet\n    Given I have the ID of an existing pet\n    When I send a DELETE request to the petstore API\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the pet should be deleted